sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Replica A
  participant S as Self-hosted server
  participant B as Replica B
  A->>A: Commit local mutation and outbox
  B->>B: Commit offline mutation and outbox
  A->>S: Send idempotent operations
  S-->>A: Acknowledge checkpoint
  B->>S: Send operations after reconnect
  S-->>B: Return missing envelopes
  S-->>A: Return B envelopes
  A->>A: Validate and reconcile
  B->>B: Validate and reconcile
